NOVA_PROJECT 1
# Synthetic verification values, SI. All six surfaces remain at 300 K.
project heated-cube
geometry cube box 0.5 0.5 0.5
mesh tets cube structured_tet 16 16 16
material homogeneous isotropic 2
study steady steady_heat tets homogeneous
source steady 240
solver steady cg jacobi 2000 1e-13 1e-14
boundary steady cube xmin temperature 300
boundary steady cube xmax temperature 300
boundary steady cube ymin temperature 300
boundary steady cube ymax temperature 300
boundary steady cube zmin temperature 300
boundary steady cube zmax temperature 300
end
